# Nothing here belongs in an image.
#
# .env* most of all. The image is the one artefact that gets pushed to a
# registry and pulled by a build system, and a secret baked into a layer stays
# in that layer even after a later one deletes it.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

node_modules
npm-debug.log*

.git
.gitignore
.github

# Tests and their fixtures. They are not run from the image, and *.db.test.ts
# would connect to a real database if anything ever did run them.
**/*.test.ts
**/__fixtures__

# Local noise.
*.md
!README.md
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
coverage
tmp
